Info: Command: quartus_pfg --list
------------------------------------------------------------------
Output file type                    Description
------------------------------------------------------------------
.bin                                A binary file containing HPS handoff data. 

.ccert                              A Quartus Compact Certificate File that 
                                    stores the data for use in device 
                                    provisioning. 

.corim                              A concise reference manifest file containing 
                                    the measurements derived from one or more 
                                    Raw Binary File(s). 

.diag                               A concise reference manifest diagnostic 
                                    notation file containing parsed information 
                                    of Concise Reference Integrity Manifest File 
                                    (.corim) or Concise Reference Integrity 
                                    Manifest Revocation File(.xcorim) in 
                                    human-readable format. 

.ekp                                A binary file containing bitstream 
                                    encryption key. 

.hexout                             An ASCII text file in Intel hexadecimal 
                                    format containing configuration data for use 
                                    outside the Quartus Prime software. 

.jam                                An ASCII text file, in the STAPL format, 
                                    that stores programming data for 
                                    programming, configuring, verifying, and 
                                    blank-checking one or more devices in a JTAG 
                                    chain. 

.jbc                                A binary file, in the STAPL format, that 
                                    stores programming data for programming, 
                                    configuring, verifying, and blank-checking 
                                    one or more devices in a JTAG chain. 

.jic                                A binary file containing serial 
                                    configuration device data and the serial 
                                    flash loader device name. 

.pof                                A binary file containing the data for 
                                    programming a MAX device or a configuration 
                                    device that can configure other devices. 

.rbf                                A binary file containing configuration data 
                                    for use outside the Quartus Prime software. 

.rim                                A reference manifest file containing the 
                                    measurements derived from one or more Raw 
                                    Binary File(s). 

.rpd                                A binary file containing flash programming 
                                    data for use outside the Quartus Prime 
                                    software to program the flash. A Raw 
                                    Programming Data File is a subset of the 
                                    Programmer Object File (.pof) or JTAG 
                                    Indirect Configuration File (.jic) file 
                                    type, containing only flash binary 
                                    programming data. 

.sof                                A binary file containing the data for 
                                    configuring all SRAM-based Altera devices. 

.svf                                An ASCII text file, in the Serial Vector 
                                    Format, that stores programming data for 
                                    programming, configuring, verifying, and 
                                    blank-checking one or more devices in a JTAG 
                                    chain. 

.ttf                                An ASCII text file in tabular format 
                                    containing configuration data for use 
                                    outside the Quartus Prime software. 

.xcorim                             A concise reference manifest revocation file 
                                    contains list of CoRIM IDs to be revoked. 

