------------------------------------------------------------------
aes_key_info                        Option to specify the .txt file that 
                                    contains the info of the user AES root key. 
                                    aes_key_info=aes_key_info.txt 

algo_type                           Specifies the cryptographic algorithm to be 
                                    disabled. algo_type = ecdsa|lms|mldsa 

alias_key_tweak                     Specifies the value to change the key tweak 
