                                    only DCMF and application image. 
                                    app_image_only=ON|OFF 

auth_obj                            Specifies the authentication object for 
                                    external authentication. The value must be 
                                    either the path to the object file (.bin) or 
                                    the SHA384 hash value of the object file for 
                                    authentication. If SHA384 hash value is 
                                    specified, the value must be in HEX string 
                                    with 48 bytes length. 

bitswap                             Swap bit order within a byte of Raw 
                                    Programming Data File (*.rpd). bitswap = 
                                    ON|OFF(default) 

cancel_all_keys                     Specifies whether to cancel all old AES keys 
                                    that provisioned in the device. 
                                    cancel_all_keys=<ON|OFF> 

